        "dropdown_information_kn4a3k": {
          "type": "dropdown_information",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Spacious Open-Top Design",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Safety and comfort go hand in hand. For active protection, built-in infrared sensors and an anti-pinch design continuously monitor for contact, automatically pausing operation if a cat is inside or touching the unit, ensuring complete peace of mind. The open-top layout meets your cat's instincts with clear visibility and multiple exit points, creating a more open space where cats feel safer and more in control, ideal for large breeds transitioning from traditional boxes.</p>",
            "default_open": true
          }
        },
        "dropdown_information_kgUQkG": {
          "type": "dropdown_information",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Multi-Cat Friendly",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Supports cats 3.3–18 lbs and multi-cat households (not suitable for kittens under 6 months). Automatic cleaning after each use keeps the litter box hygienic and convenient.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "dropdown_information_fN8k8c": {
          "type": "dropdown_information",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Large Capacity and Filtered Waste",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Includes two mesh filters and works with all clumping litter types (clay, tofu and mixed). The built-in 8.9 L sealed waste bin stores multiple cleanings and locks in odors. Single-cat households can go 7–10 days between emptying, reducing frequent litter disposal.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "dropdown_information_wbgYrB": {
          "type": "dropdown_information",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Smart App Control",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Track the past 7 days of litter box activity and adjust settings remotely via the app (2.4GHz Wi-Fi only). Supports auto, manual, scheduled, and empty modes, plus “Do Not Disturb.” Easy smartphone setup—no complex buttons. Monitor your cat’s habits over time to notice changes.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "dropdown_information_tYfaye": {
          "type": "dropdown_information",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the Box?",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Main Unit X1 comes with butterfly-shaped mesh holes (suitable for mineral or bentonite litter and includes a high-performance anti-stick internal liner (pre-instta), along with a waste bin, four support legs, 15 garbage bags (one roll), one litter sifter with vertical strip mesh holes (for tofu or mixed litter), one adapter, two deodorizing boxes, and one user manual.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
